  "verified_behavior": [
    "Task digest/closed public fields, repository origin and base commit validated before client creation; isolated source base/work shared across branches, fresh disjoint evidence/source/cache paths and symlink rejection.",
    "Source admission occurs before prepare/base/work; snapshots and run evidence use guarded persistence, and only read/search/list source tools are exposed.",
    "One client composes native recycler/phase driver across planner/investigations/join. Pre-model callback checks cancellation/shared health and all provider receipt families.",
    "Terminal native export is reconstructed from branch ranges, recorded request/response/packet events and snapshots and must equal episode export; base cleanliness checked.",
    "Unknown model failure retains earlier240scriptedtokens plus unknown1 and stops later calls; dispatch denial sends0models and persists failed result. Raw receipts survive outer orchestration error paths."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Tests use scripted measurements/model replies and stub client ledger binding; actual GLM durable ledger integration is evidenced separately, not exercised by this repository fixture.",
    "Source admission is monitoring rather than kernel quota. Final campaign must bind actual storage callbacks, task/profile/deadlines and fresh source identity.",
    "Exceptional unknown accounting can omit top-level usage summary; consumers must reconcile retained raw receipts/phase state and conservative reservations, never treat missing summary as zero.",
    "In-flight cancellation/settlement, protocol-valid bounded histories, common baselines, three-arm scoring/twelve-outcome supervision and real tokenizer qualification remain later campaign work."
  ],
